OL,3,GNEWSALearner driver arrested as child
OL,4,Aseriously injured
OL,5,
OL,6,FA learner driver has been arrested
OL,7,Fafter a child on a bicycle sustained
OL,8,Flife-threatening injuries in a
OL,9,Fcollision with a car.
OL,11,FThe incident involving a red Citroen C4
OL,12,Fhappened on St Martin's Way, Thetford,
OL,13,Fjust before 15:00 BST on Sunday.
OL,15,FThe boy was airlifted to Addenbrooke's
OL,16,FHospital in Cambridge, where he
OL,17,Fremains, Norfolk Police said.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
