OL,4,Aseriously injured
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo women in the Citroen, a learner
OL,7,Fdriver in her 30s and a supervising
OL,8,Fpassenger in her 50s, were arrested on
OL,9,Fsuspicion of drug driving and causing
OL,10,Fserious injury by dangerous driving.
